    "description": "A Python library for building, converting, and simulating Boolean and semi-quantitative Boolean network models. Wraps pyboolnet for prime-implicant-based Boolean algebra and adds network I/O (SBML-qual, GraphML, bnet, SIF, Cytoscape), ODE-based continuous/semi-quantitative relaxations of Boolean models, and simulation-result plotting.",
